{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/990120-lodge-update-raw-material-lodge-of-the-fallen-idol","id":990120,"title":"Lodge Update Raw Material: Lodge of the Fallen Idol","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-19T14:57:51-07:00","id":990120,"title":"Lodge Update Raw Material: Lodge of the Fallen Idol","content":"I didn't really like most of the Lodges in 1E, on the basis that there really wasn't much of a good organizing principle. Same for much of 1E Forsaken. I did like the Fallen as a concept, even if the writer was still high on the Dark Atheism drug much of the cWoD was on (before you ask, I'm as agnostic as they come-I just think that ship sailed a long time ago, and I've been exposed to too much real militant atheism for me to like truly straight anti-theism. Too mean for my tastes). However, at their core (a group dedicated to preventing human religious belief from toxifying the Shadow) was a good core.<br /> <br /> So, I decided there might be a good update to turn them into something new and better, with their own niche in terms of sacred prey-they hunt creatures that claim to godhood or special privileges with the divine. The Lodge is sour on all unprovable beliefs, especially those without even circumstantial supernatural evidence (so, ironically, the Malleus Maleficarum is an organization they are less angry at-their miracles come from <i>somewhere</i>), but they <i>loathe</i> hypocrites who use those beliefs, knowingly or not, for selfish and destructive ends. To that end, the Fallen do as their name implies and cast down false idols; living beings who the Accusers know are lying about their power or their celestial mandate, breaking them in such a way it kills the potential for even martyrdom.<br /> <br /> Here's what I came up with, off the top of my head:<br /> <br /> <b>Benefit: </b>The Venom of Truth running through the Fallen's veins sharpens both their tongues and minds. When convincing someone of the falseness of a belief the werewolf sincerely thinks is mistaken or a deception, her first impressions start at one step better and she needs to open one less Door than normal. When spending a Willpower on a Research roll to investigate a claim of supernatural or religious significance, she gains a 5 dice bonus rather than 3.<br /> <br /> <b>Aspiration: </b>Cast down all faiths that the Accuser blames for harming the world.<br /> <br /> <b>Ban: </b>The werewolf must not go along with any action undertook for purely ideological reasons. &quot;Propaganda for our cause&quot; is a valid reasoning in Ningizzida's view, as is &quot;for hopefully improving the lives of other people&quot;, but &quot;for the glory of the Tribe&quot; is not, and the improvement must be in a measurable, agreed-upon fashion.<br /> <br /> Not sure what the Siskur-Dah benefit would be, though. Probably something about overcoming mental influence and servitude, and if the prey is fighting back to impress its followers there's some kind of bonus based around publicly humiliating it.<br /> <br /> (Yes, this does mean the Fallen are still militantly atheistic and often annoyingly insistent on proof. I didn't say they wouldn't be, I just want it to be not unequivocally a good thing)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T15:42:30-07:00","id":990144,"title":"","content":"In this moment, I am euphoric. Not because of some phony god's blessings, but because I am enlightened by Ningizzida, the Serpent of Truth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T20:44:12-07:00","id":990237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/990120-lodge-update-raw-material-lodge-of-the-fallen-idol?p=990144#post990144\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In this moment, I am euphoric. Not because of some phony god's blessings, but because I am enlightened by Ningizzida, the Serpent of Truth.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you.<br /> <br /> Actually got an idea during Drama class-when facing his quarry when said quarry is attempting to impress a cult, the Venom of Truth boils out of the Fallen's body and into his mouth and claws. Landing a successful attack with natural weapons or spitting the Venom on his foe (requiring a successful Dexterity + Firearms roll) assaults the prey with visions of Mother Moon's nature, showing it what a <i>real, provable </i>god looks like-and she favors the People. The quarry suffers a Lunacy condition of the Accuser's choice, regardless of whether or not the quarry would normally be vulnerable to Lunacy or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}